  "details": "One solution I thought of for allowing physbones to be used for basic cloth physics would be to have physbones have the ability to behave like a web rather than a bunch of chains (where the bones can be inter-connected between chains so movements of the end of a chain get reflected in other bones on different chains)\n\nThis would make physbone based skirts a whole lot more convincing\n\nIE:",
